@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-parent-access-token
@student = 1
@main = 1
@savings = 2
@card = 1

### The child's cards
GET {{base}}/cards/?student={{student}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Freeze (immediate; POS refuses it after its next cache refresh)
POST {{base}}/cards/{{card}}/freeze/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unfreeze
POST {{base}}/cards/{{card}}/unfreeze/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report lost (permanent; the school issues a replacement)
POST {{base}}/cards/{{card}}/report-lost/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### P2P history (oversight)
GET {{base}}/students/{{student}}/p2p-history/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send to a classmate on the child's behalf (guardian of the sender)
POST {{base}}/wallets/transfer/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sender_student": {{student}}, "recipient_student": 3, "amount": "500", "note": "lunch" }
